        "SRC004906",
        "SRC004909",
        "SRC004910",
        "SRC004915",
        "SRC004917",
        "SRC006452",
        "SRC006454",
        "SRC006456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC050",
      "title": "Pouring on the Thirsty",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "God's disposition has always been to pour out His Spirit and blessing on the thirsty and on their descendants. This is stated in Isaiah 44:3, where God says, \"I will pour water on him... I will pour my spirit.\"",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "SRC005748",
            "SRC005750",
            "SRC005754"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005748",
            "SRC005750",
            "SRC005754"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "This same disposition is fulfilled in the beatitude of Jesus concerning those who hunger and thirst for righteousness: \"blessed are you... for you shall be satisfied.\"",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "SRC005762",
            "SRC005763",
            "SRC005766"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005762",
            "SRC005763",
            "SRC005766"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "The teaching anchors the reception of more of God in one single condition: spiritual hunger. God is no respecter of persons; he wants to reveal himself and to be discovered by all who hunger for him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "SRC005771",
            "SRC005775",
            "SRC005778",
            "SRC005780"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005771",
            "SRC005775",
            "SRC005778",
            "SRC005780"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        }
      ],
